<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection — Code-to-model traceability: 60/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions have one-line docstrings (L31-110), but do not map code sections to Metzger et al. (2008) Figs. 1-4, Menshykau et al. (2014) Eqs. 1-5, or the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_053_lung_stereotyped_branching_modes.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
