    pk:evidenceAgainst "2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py L31–L110: Lacks equation-level and Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py#L31-L110>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection — Model fidelity to source: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements basic 3D Frenet-frame rotations for isolated P (Delta_phi=0 deg) and O (Delta_phi=90 deg) bifurcations and a 4-bud D trunk (L31-99), but does not compose subroutines into Metzger et al.'s (2008) master lobar lineage trees (D -> P/O) and completely omits the Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 receptor-ligand reaction-diffusion PDE system and growth-speed mode-selection switch." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py L31–L99: Isolated D, P, O stick-tree generator without compound D->P/O grammar or FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing PDE <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py#L31-L99>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection — Morphometric validation: 48/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` reports only 3 trivial geometric scalars (tip count = 4, planar flatness = 0, dihedral angle = 90 deg, L151-171) without comparing against the 8 empirical E11-E15 mouse lung lineage benchmarks or E11-E15 tip timecourse in `lung_stereotyped_branching_modes_reference.json`, and without random-dihedral or non-Turing ablation controls." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py L151–L171: 3 scalar checks lacking empirical lineage RMSE/r, Turing wavelength validation, or ablation controls <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py#L151-L171>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-measurement-2-generation-bifurcation-distal-tip-count>,
